  "identity_requirement": "A resumable AP-stop owner must be created at the original operation boundary and carry an immutable operation generation plus scope/request identity through refusal and retry. Function address, adapter pointer, current BSS/MAC, or reread configuration alone cannot prove the retry is the same operation.",
